<title>GERMANY: Bertrand 1995/96 net profit rises sharply.</title>
<headline>Bertrand 1995/96 net profit rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to end September 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   3.1     vs 1.9</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    9.4     vs 4.9</p>
<p>    Group sales				  102.7   vs 71.2</p>
<p>    No of employees			    663     vs 520</p>
<p>    Dividend				     0.80 marks</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German car distributor group is Bertrandt AG. Employee figures include freelance engineers.</p>
</text>
